Scope and data notice

This license covers the source code and documentation in this repository only.

The data come from the US National Health and Nutrition Examination Survey
(NHANES), published by the CDC National Center for Health Statistics as public-use
files. NHANES data are not redistributed here: `python -m src.data.nhanes`
downloads them from the CDC. Users must follow the NCHS data use restrictions
(https://www.cdc.gov/nchs/data_access/restrictions.htm), including making no
attempt to identify any participant.

The committed result files contain predictions and aggregate statistics, not
NHANES records. The demo model (models/primary_logreg_A.json) holds only
aggregate parameters and coefficients. The software is for research and
teaching; it is not a medical device and must not be used for diagnosis.
